WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.167
-The committee investigating

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:04.534
Donald Trump's coup attempt
on January 6th

00:00:04.534 --> 00:00:06.868
is preparing to hold
its first televised hearing

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:08.300
in primetime on Thursday,

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.968
and Republicans, predictably,
are already lying about it.

00:00:10.968 --> 00:00:13.033
For more on this.
It's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:15.234
♪♪

00:00:15.234 --> 00:00:17.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:19.467
The Republican paranoia
about voter fraud

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:20.968
has gotten so unhinged

00:00:20.968 --> 00:00:23.701
that they're now accusing each
other of stealing elections.

00:00:23.701 --> 00:00:25.834
In Georgia, for example,
Trump and his allies

00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:28.234
targeted ultra-conservative
Governor Brian Kemp

00:00:28.234 --> 00:00:31.834
for the sole reason that Kemp
refused to single-handedly

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:33.801
overturn Joe Biden's
win in 2020.

00:00:33.801 --> 00:00:36.834
Kemp easily defeated his
primary opponents last month,

00:00:36.834 --> 00:00:39.634
including a Trump loyalist
named Candace Taylor,

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:43.000
who came in third and lost to
Kemp by more than 70 points.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.267
But MyPillow CEO --
and your -- and your pillow.

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:48.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:51.501
MyPillow CEO Mike Lindell
looked carefully at the data

00:00:51.501 --> 00:00:53.334
and came to
the unfortunate conclusion

00:00:53.334 --> 00:00:55.300
that something fishy
is going on.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:57.834
-Brian Kemp they put so high up
that they wanted --

00:00:57.834 --> 00:01:01.200
they didn't even want --
"Why, he got 73%!

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.934
How could you take
his other votes?"

00:01:02.934 --> 00:01:04.667
Well, let me tell you,
everybody,

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:08.634
we have preliminary evidence
that Candace Taylor,

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:11.667
for every single vote
that Kemp got,

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:15.968
he took her -- got their votes,
and then Candace got 5% back.

00:01:15.968 --> 00:01:21.567
-What? He took her votes
and then she got 5% back?

00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:24.834
Are you confusing elections
with credit cards?

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:27.801
"You get 5% cash back
on every vote

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:30.400
and double points on travel
and restaurants

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.868
and concrete pillows
when you choose Capital One.

00:01:33.868 --> 00:01:36.000
Capital One --
what's in your wallet?

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.901
No, what's in there?
What's in there?

00:01:37.901 --> 00:01:40.901
Is that a ballot in there?
Are you trying to smuggle votes?

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:44.334
What's -- Tell me
what's in your wallet!

00:01:44.334 --> 00:01:47.334
I'm making
a citizen wallet check!"

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:50.901
Trump himself did the same thing

00:01:50.901 --> 00:01:53.801
before his preferred candidate
for Senate in Pennsylvania.

00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:56.901
Dr. Oz won
the GOP primary there.

00:01:56.901 --> 00:02:01.100
-Fewer than 2,000 votes
now separating TV Dr. Mehmet Oz,

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.734
who has a slight lead,

00:02:02.734 --> 00:02:05.200
and former hedge fund
executive David McCormick.

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:06.801
Today, Trump urged Oz

00:02:06.801 --> 00:02:09.534
not to wait for all the votes
to be counted.

00:02:09.534 --> 00:02:13.000
"Dr. Oz should declare victory,"
the former president said.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.601
"It makes it much harder for
them to cheat with the ballots

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:17.334
that they just happened
to find."

00:02:17.334 --> 00:02:20.100
-Of course, Trump and Oz
teamed up to scam people.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.601
They're like the Jordan
and Pippen of con artists.

00:02:22.601 --> 00:02:25.300
Or maybe the Jordan
and BJ Armstrong.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.534
You're no Pippen, Oz!

00:02:27.534 --> 00:02:29.000
At this point,
I wouldn't be surprised

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.868
if Dr. Oz started using Trump
to sell his bogus diet pills.

00:02:31.868 --> 00:02:34.100
He'd use this same picture
for the before and after.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.067
And Trump's supporters
would still say,

00:02:36.067 --> 00:02:39.467
"You can't argue
with the results."

00:02:39.467 --> 00:02:41.167
This is where the big lie
has led them.

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:43.000
According to Trump
and his gang of weirdos,

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.601
anyone they don't support
is cheating.

00:02:44.601 --> 00:02:45.934
This is the lie, of course,

00:02:45.934 --> 00:02:48.501
that led to the violent
coup attempt on January 6th.

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:50.734
And as the committee
investigating that coup attempt

00:02:50.734 --> 00:02:53.567
prepares to hold its first
nationally televised

00:02:53.567 --> 00:02:55.000
hearing in primetime
on Thursday,

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.901
you'll never guess which

00:02:56.901 --> 00:02:58.901
supposed the news network
has decided

00:02:58.901 --> 00:03:00.934
not to air the hearing live.

00:03:00.934 --> 00:03:02.133
Well, I mean,
of course you'll guess,

00:03:02.133 --> 00:03:03.534
but we're going to show you
the clip anyway,

00:03:03.534 --> 00:03:06.200
because, like, we had to,
like, find it and edit it down

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.400
and it was just like really
hard work.

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:08.501
So take a look.

00:03:08.501 --> 00:03:11.400
-Fox News making
a programing decision.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:14.300
It's sticking with its
primetime lineup on Thursday --

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.434
Tucker Carlson and Sean Hannity.

00:03:16.434 --> 00:03:19.300
This is instead of showing
the January 6 Select Committee

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.868
hearing concerning
the Capitol Hill riot.

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:24.701
-It doesn't surprise me that Fox
isn't airing the hearings.

00:03:24.701 --> 00:03:28.067
Fox is news the same way
"The Kardashians" is reality.

00:03:28.067 --> 00:03:31.968
Just once, I'd love to see
an actual reality TV show,

00:03:31.968 --> 00:03:34.634
something called, I don't know,
"Man Quietly Eating a Cinnabon

00:03:34.634 --> 00:03:37.300
Because He Missed
His Connection at LaGuardia."

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:40.133
It's the best reality show
set in an airport

00:03:40.133 --> 00:03:42.534
since "Former Mayor Shaves
While Eating Soup."

00:03:42.534 --> 00:03:44.133
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:47.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:54.667
Well, they're having an issue
with the machine.

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:56.934
We have a machine
that helps the jokes.

00:03:56.934 --> 00:03:59.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:00.767
Hey! [ Laughs ]

00:04:00.767 --> 00:04:03.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:06.234 --> 00:04:07.734
Thank you, Machine!

00:04:07.734 --> 00:04:09.067
[ Laughter ]

00:04:09.067 --> 00:04:11.300
I'm sorry I crossed you,
Machine!

00:04:15.501 --> 00:04:17.968
It's not a surprise because Fox
constantly says

00:04:17.968 --> 00:04:20.400
the opposite of what
the hearings will say.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.200
The committee will lay out
the truth of what happened

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.100
and Fox will lie.

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:24.000
It's that simple.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.133
The hearings will say

00:04:25.133 --> 00:04:27.133
January 6th
was a violent insurrection

00:04:27.133 --> 00:04:28.801
fomented
by an outgoing president

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:30.868
who nearly pulled off
a detailed plan

00:04:30.868 --> 00:04:33.567
for an attempted coup
to unlawfully cling to power

00:04:33.567 --> 00:04:36.000
that would have installed him
as an unelected autocrat

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.400
and destroyed
American democracy.

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:40.934
And Fox will say it was just
a pro-freedom patriot party,

00:04:40.934 --> 00:04:42.968
where everyone peacefully
toured the Capitol

00:04:42.968 --> 00:04:44.400
like they were
on a school field trip

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.300
having to find items
their teachers gave them

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.300
on a worksheet.

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:50.234
"I got podium!"
[ Laughter ]

00:04:50.234 --> 00:04:52.501
In fact,
the January 6th investigation

00:04:52.501 --> 00:04:54.667
has already provided us
with one bombshell

00:04:54.667 --> 00:04:56.200
after another --
from the revelation

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:59.234
that Trump ignored pleas
from friends and family members

00:04:59.234 --> 00:05:01.767
to stop the violence
as he watched it unfold on TV,

00:05:01.767 --> 00:05:05.367
to various detailed plans
written by multiple Trump aides

00:05:05.367 --> 00:05:07.567
to get Mike Pence
to overturn the results

00:05:07.567 --> 00:05:09.667
to a series
of shocking revelations

00:05:09.667 --> 00:05:13.267
that make clear Trump put Pence
in direct physical danger.

00:05:13.267 --> 00:05:15.501
-This stunning new report
in "The New York Times"

00:05:15.501 --> 00:05:18.434
says that a top aide to
former Vice President Mike Pence

00:05:18.434 --> 00:05:20.834
warned the Secret Service
that President Trump

00:05:20.834 --> 00:05:22.701
could turn
on the vice president,

00:05:22.701 --> 00:05:24.801
and the aide feared
for Pence's safety

00:05:24.801 --> 00:05:26.868
on the eve of the Capitol riot.

00:05:26.868 --> 00:05:30.267
-So, when
his Secret Service agents,

00:05:30.267 --> 00:05:33.300
including one of them
who had -- was carrying

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:35.701
the nuclear football with him,

00:05:35.701 --> 00:05:39.167
were chased out
by these neo-fascists,

00:05:39.167 --> 00:05:42.367
and they ran down
to some still undisclosed,

00:05:42.367 --> 00:05:47.000
mysterious place
in the Capitol.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.300
He uttered what I think
are the six most

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:52.834
chilling words of this
entire thing I've seen so far.

00:05:52.834 --> 00:05:54.901
He said, "I'm not
getting in that car."

00:05:54.901 --> 00:05:56.367
-"The New York Times" reports

00:05:56.367 --> 00:05:59.934
January 6 Committee testimony
shows former President Trump

00:05:59.934 --> 00:06:01.467
approved chants about

00:06:01.467 --> 00:06:04.067
hanging former Vice President
Mike Pence.

00:06:04.067 --> 00:06:05.334
In last year's attacks,

00:06:05.334 --> 00:06:08.534
some rioters started chanting
"hang Mike Pence."

00:06:08.534 --> 00:06:09.801
Well, according to the report,

00:06:09.801 --> 00:06:12.067
White House Chief of Staff
Mark Meadows testified

00:06:12.067 --> 00:06:14.167
he told colleagues
Trump agreed that

00:06:14.167 --> 00:06:16.167
maybe Pence should be hanged.

00:06:16.167 --> 00:06:18.167
-"Maybe Pence should be hanged."

00:06:18.167 --> 00:06:19.834
Do you think Pence
is more offended

00:06:19.834 --> 00:06:21.868
that Trump expressed support
for the idea of hanging him,

00:06:21.868 --> 00:06:23.801
or that Trump
did it the same way

00:06:23.801 --> 00:06:25.968
my aunts order appetizers?

00:06:25.968 --> 00:06:29.901
"Should we get the order of
mozzarella sticks or two orders?

00:06:29.901 --> 00:06:30.901
We're going to need the energy

00:06:30.901 --> 00:06:32.067
if we're going to
hang Mike Pence.

00:06:32.067 --> 00:06:34.634
Should we, though?"
[ Laughter ]

00:06:34.634 --> 00:06:36.434
So the vice president's
chief of staff

00:06:36.434 --> 00:06:38.000
warned the Secret Service
that the president

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.601
was putting him
in physical danger.

00:06:39.601 --> 00:06:41.901
The vice president then refused
to get in the car

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:44.434
when the Secret Service tried to
whisk him away from the Capitol,

00:06:44.434 --> 00:06:46.334
and the president
casually suggested

00:06:46.334 --> 00:06:48.767
that maybe his own
vice president should be hanged.

00:06:48.767 --> 00:06:52.000
I feel like even Aaron Burr
would be like, "Dude, cool it,"

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:56.501
and Aaron Burr shot a guy
while rapping.

00:06:56.501 --> 00:06:58.834
What's that?

00:06:58.834 --> 00:07:00.133
Oh, the rapping
didn't actually happen?

00:07:00.133 --> 00:07:01.901
That was just that...?

00:07:01.901 --> 00:07:04.067
So they just did that
for the Broadway show?

00:07:04.067 --> 00:07:07.167
That's going to break my kid's
heart when I tell him that.

00:07:07.167 --> 00:07:09.767
Republicans like to pretend that
instead of looking back at 2020,

00:07:09.767 --> 00:07:11.767
we should be focusing on issues
that matter to average

00:07:11.767 --> 00:07:14.567
Americans, like gas prices,
even though they're the ones

00:07:14.567 --> 00:07:16.200
who are obsessed
with the 2020 election.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.334
And also they don't have
a serious plan

00:07:18.334 --> 00:07:19.801
for dealing with gas prices.

00:07:19.801 --> 00:07:22.834
-This is the biggest scam
on Thursday

00:07:22.834 --> 00:07:26.067
perpetrated
on the American people

00:07:26.067 --> 00:07:28.234
since the Russia collusion hoax.

00:07:28.234 --> 00:07:31.868
This is total nonsense that
you're going to see on Thursday.

00:07:31.868 --> 00:07:34.133
And the problem is they know it.

00:07:34.133 --> 00:07:37.133
The Democrats know people
do not care about this.

00:07:37.133 --> 00:07:40.467
They're desperately trying
to get people to buy into this.

00:07:40.467 --> 00:07:43.067
But the problem is,
people are more concerned, Sean,

00:07:43.067 --> 00:07:45.133
with the super high gas prices.

00:07:45.133 --> 00:07:48.701
-What we have found with
one-party rule of Democrats

00:07:48.701 --> 00:07:51.868
taking over the House,
the Senate and the presidency --

00:07:51.868 --> 00:07:55.467
they use the power to go
after their political opponents

00:07:55.467 --> 00:07:58.033
instead of bringing down
gasoline prices.

00:07:58.033 --> 00:08:02.000
Today, it has now doubled
since the gasoline price

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.033
since President Biden
has taken office.

00:08:04.033 --> 00:08:05.934
Are they going to have
any hearings on that?

00:08:05.934 --> 00:08:08.968
-You know, I actually would
like hearings on gas prices,

00:08:08.968 --> 00:08:11.634
but I'd love for Congress
to haul the big oil CEOs in

00:08:11.634 --> 00:08:13.133
to ask them how much profit
they're making,

00:08:13.133 --> 00:08:14.934
which I'm guessing
isn't Kevin McCarthy's idea.

00:08:14.934 --> 00:08:18.868
He'd probably just call
an actual gas pump to testify.

00:08:18.868 --> 00:08:21.701
"Sir, you claim to be both super
and premium.

00:08:21.701 --> 00:08:23.067
Is that not redundant?

00:08:23.067 --> 00:08:25.501
I yield the floor
for your answer."

00:08:25.501 --> 00:08:28.000
Look, we'd all rather be talking
about other stuff,

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:30.701
but you guys are the ones trying
to destroy American democracy.

00:08:30.701 --> 00:08:32.801
You're like a bunch of arsonists
who burned down a house.

00:08:32.801 --> 00:08:34.667
And then when the fire
department shows up, you say,

00:08:34.667 --> 00:08:36.901
"Um, shouldn't you guys
be working on

00:08:36.901 --> 00:08:38.601
this year's sexy calendar?

00:08:38.601 --> 00:08:39.968
[ Laughter ]

00:08:39.968 --> 00:08:41.934
Get your priorities straight."

00:08:41.934 --> 00:08:43.634
Now, luckily, there's more
than enough time for them

00:08:43.634 --> 00:08:45.334
to put out the fire
and pose for the calendar,

00:08:45.334 --> 00:08:47.601
because we all really want
that calendar, and fun fact,

00:08:47.601 --> 00:08:50.467
I auditioned for it one year
and they told me I was in,

00:08:50.467 --> 00:08:52.200
but then they gave me
a fake month

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:54.267
that wasn't even in the calendar

00:08:54.267 --> 00:08:56.234
called Junevembruary.

00:08:56.234 --> 00:08:58.701
[ Laughter ]

00:08:58.701 --> 00:09:00.434
We did that joke mainly to see

00:09:00.434 --> 00:09:02.601
what kind of upper body
Graphics gave me.

00:09:02.601 --> 00:09:04.434
And once again...

00:09:04.434 --> 00:09:05.801
they [bleep] me.

00:09:05.801 --> 00:09:08.434
[ Laughter ]

00:09:08.434 --> 00:09:11.834
Republicans do this infuriating
thing where they're the ones

00:09:11.834 --> 00:09:13.701
threatening to dismantle
American democracy.

00:09:13.701 --> 00:09:15.100
And when we try to do
something about it,

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:17.267
they say, "How come you're
not focused on gas prices?"

00:09:17.267 --> 00:09:18.601
Also, by the way,

00:09:18.601 --> 00:09:21.200
they don't have a real plan
for gas prices either,

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.968
other than drill more,
which would do very little,

00:09:22.968 --> 00:09:24.334
since fossil fuel companies

00:09:24.334 --> 00:09:26.133
already have thousands
of unused permits

00:09:26.133 --> 00:09:28.100
for millions of acres
of federal land

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:30.400
they're not even using, and
additional energy production

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:32.000
wouldn't hit the market
for months anyway.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.067
There isn't some
miracle solution here.

00:09:34.067 --> 00:09:37.100
You can't just give your car
a patented Dr. Oz gas pill.

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:39.033
If Republicans
were really serious

00:09:39.033 --> 00:09:40.901
about focusing on other stuff,

00:09:40.901 --> 00:09:43.434
they'd be talking about urgent
crises that affect real people,

00:09:43.434 --> 00:09:45.567
like the cost of living crisis,
wealth inequality,

00:09:45.567 --> 00:09:47.534
health care, education,
climate change,

00:09:47.534 --> 00:09:49.300
food insecurity,
or child poverty.

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:50.801
According to a recent survey,

00:09:50.801 --> 00:09:53.100
nearly half of families
with kids

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:55.234
who used to get
the expanded child tax credit

00:09:55.234 --> 00:09:57.100
can't afford enough food
after the program

00:09:57.100 --> 00:09:58.067
ended five months ago.

00:09:58.067 --> 00:09:59.367
Our political system

00:09:59.367 --> 00:10:01.300
has seemingly just forgotten
about that,

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:02.901
but it's outrageous
and unconscionable,

00:10:02.901 --> 00:10:04.300
especially in a world
where one dude

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:05.901
can just flip over
his couch cushions

00:10:05.901 --> 00:10:07.734
and find $44 billion
to buy Twitter --

00:10:07.734 --> 00:10:10.434
a dumb website that's only good
for posting Wordle scores

00:10:10.434 --> 00:10:15.167
and fighting with anonymous
accounts named WallyFan8275678,

00:10:15.167 --> 00:10:16.534
who keep tweeting stuff
and be like,

00:10:16.534 --> 00:10:18.901
"We need more Wally on the
show."

00:10:18.901 --> 00:10:20.334
-That's not me, Seth.

00:10:20.334 --> 00:10:21.901
-What? I didn't even say
was you, Wally.

00:10:21.901 --> 00:10:24.100
-Okay. Good.
Because it's definitely not.

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:25.767
-Oh, well, if it's
definitely not,

00:10:25.767 --> 00:10:27.100
then I'll just respond
to that tweet

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:30.601
and your phone definitely won't
get a notification.

00:10:30.601 --> 00:10:33.400
[ Cellphone chimes ]

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.067
Whoa, did you get a text, Wally?

00:10:36.067 --> 00:10:38.501
-Yeah. Uh, oh.

00:10:38.501 --> 00:10:41.100
No. It's just
my local animal shelter.

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:43.567
They want me to...
They want to take me

00:10:43.567 --> 00:10:44.567
for a volunteering.

